# Session bootstrap written by the /handoff skill. Per-machine, point-in-time, and goes stale
# fast -- committing it would ship a stale bootstrap to anyone who clones. Never committed in this
# repo's history either, so this only makes the existing practice explicit.
HANDOFF.md

