# Codex review transcripts (reviews/_<name>_prompt.txt and _raw_output.txt). Regenerated by
# reviews/run-codex-review.ps1 on every run and up to 2.4MB each; 4.0MB was tracked before
# 2026-08-25. The DISTILLED findings in docs/reviews/ are the durable record -- these are
# terminal scrollback with a commit hash attached.
reviews/_*_prompt.txt
reviews/_*_raw_output.txt
